    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan first catches it, it is a rank one Gu, and that rank one form is still worth more than several rank two Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          14
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The same rank one label appears again while he is refining it.",
        "chapters": [
          17
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Qing Shu later stresses that rank one Liquor worm only refines rank one green copper essence, so it is useless once Fang Yuan is rank two unless he fuses it upward.",
        "chapters": [
          105
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_gu_yue_qing_shu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "No cited chapter assigns the Liquor worm to a named cultivation path.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is shaped like a silkworm, its entire body giving out pearl white light. It is a little chubby and has a cute appearance. When it flies, it curls up into a ball. Drunk, it looks like a small and white rice dumpling. Its tail is like a silkworm’s tail, chubby and rounded, and the light it emits makes people think of a pearl.",
        "chapters": [
          14
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Its body size is slightly bigger than the Moonlight Gu, soft and white like a silkworm. Under the light its body is shrouded in a layer of faint wavering light, just like a pearl’s mellow luster. Two little eyes resembling two black sesame seeds are mounted on its chubby white head.",
        "chapters": [
          17
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After refinement it returns to a fat and white state, and can twist around its chubby waist.",
        "chapters": [
          20
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The Liquor worm takes a Gu Master’s current primeval essence and raises that essence by one small realm. A rank one initial stage Gu Master who uses it holds rank one middle stage essence instead.",
        "chapters": [
          29
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan feeds a tenth of his initial stage essence into the worm; the worm returns liquor mist; a second tenth of essence passes through that mist and comes out halved in volume but middle stage in quality.",
        "chapters": [
          34
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The same middle stage essence is what lets his Moonlight Gu cut deeper than an initial stage moonblade should.",
        "chapters": [
          35
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Even before the worm is fully refined, its own wine fragrance already produces a gleam of middle stage essence in his aperture.",
        "chapters": [
          17
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Once refined, the conversion is under his control.",
        "chapters": [
          20
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It becomes the ordinary way he cultivates through the opening arcs.",
        "chapters": [
          29
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The worm feeds on wine. That cost is part of why holding it is both an advantage and a drain: keeping the worm alive spends wine.",
        "chapters": [
          14
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Every conversion also spends essence.",
        "chapters": [
          29
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Green bamboo wine is the early bait and feed stock.",
        "chapters": [
          14
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Monkey wine is a later feed wine.",
        "chapters": [
          44
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Honey wine is a later fusion wine.",
        "chapters": [
          111
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Those liquors are covered on green bamboo wine, monkey wine, and honey wine.",
        "chapters": [
          14
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "res_green_bamboo_wine",
          "sys_monkey_wine",
          "res_honey_wine"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
