  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "After the academy retells the Flower Wine Monk story, Fang Yuan recalls the Liquor worm from prior-life memory. The class never names the worm. He already knows it as a precious Gu, better as a vital Gu than the clan’s Moonlight Gu, and he spends the next stretch hunting it with wine.",
        "chapters": [
          7
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_flower_wine_monk",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_vital_gu",
          "gu_moonlight_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Nine Eyes Liquor worm is like a silkworm and is pure white like a pearl. There are no eyes on its head. It has nine colors that resemble eyes, red, orange, yellow, green, blue and so on, as if they were precious gems embedded on its body.",
        "chapters": [
          326
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "shang-city",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_nine_eyes_liquor_worm"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan finds the worm by baiting it with green bamboo wine, follows it to a cave, and takes it from the Flower Wine Monk’s remains.",
        "chapters": [
          14
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "capture-and-early-ownership",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The worm carries the Monk’s leftover will, which is why the first refinement attempt is harder than refining an ordinary rank one Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          17
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "capture-and-early-ownership",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He finishes refining it days later, after using the Spring Autumn Cicada’s aura to break that will, and the worm enters his aperture as a Gu he can command.",
        "chapters": [
          20
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "capture-and-early-ownership",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "From that point it is his working cultivator Gu, not a prize he is still negotiating for.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "capture-and-early-ownership",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s prior-life memory already names the rank two Four Flavors Liquor worm and rank three Seven Fragrances Liquor worm as the essence-refining fusion line.",
        "chapters": [
          105
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "four-flavours-liquor-worm",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_seven_fragrances_liquor_worm"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later he fuses two Liquor worms with four flavours of wine and produces a Four Flavours Liquor worm. That version does the same small-realm refinement at rank two: it can raise rank two primeval essence by one small realm.",
        "chapters": [
          121
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "four-flavours-liquor-worm",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Liquor worm at rank one purifies green copper primeval essence by a small realm. Four Flavours Liquor worm at rank two does the same for red steel essence. Seven Fragrances Liquor worm at rank three does it for white silver essence. Nine Eyes Liquor worm at rank four does it for yellow gold essence. That recipe line has no liquor-worm form at rank five.",
        "chapters": [
          326
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "higher-grades",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan refines a Nine Eyes Liquor worm in Shang Clan City once he has the materials and the intermediate grades in hand.",
        "chapters": [
          326
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "higher-grades",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_shang_clan_city"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later dialogue states a legend: combining Wine Emperor’s three sovereign five emperor wines can yield a rank eight liquor worm Immortal Gu. That Gu is said to turn rank eight white litchi immortal essence into rank nine yellow apricot immortal essence.",
        "chapters": [
          1191
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "immortal-form",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_wine_emperor",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The chapter does not name a current holder of that Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [],
